            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kathy Bajo-Moeller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Ono! I made it with just chicken thighs cuz that's all I had on hand. I also wrapped the bundle in foil as I don't have ti leaves here in AZ. I did add alittle liguid smoke. Served with steamed rice and mac salad. ONO!",
            "datePublished": "2010-02-28T15:33:01.433Z"
          },
          {
